`qlab/universes/sp500_removals.csv` and `removed_with_data.csv` are records of
public facts (ticker symbols and dates of index membership changes) rather than
creative works. Their compilation and the independent cross-check that verified
them are documented in `qlab/universes/PROVENANCE.md`, which attributes the
English Wikipedia article "List of S&P 500 companies" as the source.

`qlab/prosperity/` is an unofficial reimplementation of the IMC Prosperity
interface shape, written from public description. It is not IMC code and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by IMC.
